<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63728" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογιστ-ήριον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the place</i> at Athens
				<i>where the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογισταί</span>
			<i>met</i>, Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.78
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				20.10
			</span></i>; later of any <i>office</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. τῶν νομαρχικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Klio</u>
					12.365
				</span></i>
			 (Alexandria, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2p.26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				24.38
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατιωτικὸν
			λ.</span> war-<i>office</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.2.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογιστήρια, τά,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογισταί</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				446
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνενεγκάτω ὁ ταμίας . . τῷ
				πρώτῳ λογιστηρίῳ</span> at the first <i>meeting of the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογισταί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1219.36
			</span></i> (Gambreum, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>reckoning-board, abacus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				30.15
			</span></i>; called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράπεζα λογιστηρία</span>
			by <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.158
			</span></i>.</div>
